OL,3,GNEWSACost of 1,500-home regeneration   
OL,4,Aproject increases                      
OL,6,FA major regeneration project which     
OL,7,Fincludes 1,500 new homes has had an    
OL,8,Fadditional #198.7m added to its budget,
OL,9,Fafter councillors were told cost       
OL,10,Fincreases were down to factors "outside
OL,11,Fthe council's control".                
OL,13,FThe budget increase takes the total    
OL,14,Fcost of the project to #527.6m.        
OL,16,FWhen completed, Guildford Borough      
OL,17,FCouncil's Weyside Urban Village project
OL,18,Fwill see much of the Slyfield          
OL,19,Findustrial estate transformed.         
